			"biography" : "Varix is a blood-soaked necromancer who perfected the art of the Bloody Burn. He binds living essence into bone, turning ordinary skeletons into vessels of fire and thirst. Under his command, Blood Skeletons become engines of relentless vampiric flame, rising again and again from the ashes of battle.",
